### API Gateway Requests Collection (Port 8080)
# Gateway routes incoming traffic through port 8080, terminates and validates JWT, 
# and transparently populates downstream security headers: X-User-Id, X-User-Roles, X-User-Name.

### Variables
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...

### 1. Authenticate via Gateway (Public Route -> Identity Service :8081)
# @name login
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dr.smith",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Verify Rejection Without Token (Protected Route -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Accept: application/json

### 3. Verify Rejection With Invalid/Tampered Token (Protected Route -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/doctors
Authorization: Bearer invalid-malformed-token
Accept: application/json

### 4. Fetch Patient Directory through Gateway (Routed to Patient Service :8082)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/patients?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch Doctor Directory through Gateway (Routed to Doctor Service :8083)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/doctors?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Book Appointment through Gateway (Routed to Appointment Service :8084)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "c0436a7c-67a8-451e-b733-fc3082c43262",
  "doctorId": "a7a04e33-3575-422c-837f-5a5a27dbc1f7",
  "startTime": "2026-10-25T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-10-25T10:30:00Z"
}

### 7. Record Consultation through Gateway (Routed to Consultation Service :8085)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/consultations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": "0cb1d59d-b013-46e0-ae31-88e5faaac394",
  "patientId": "c0436a7c-67a8-451e-b733-fc3082c43262",
  "doctorId": "a7a04e33-3575-422c-837f-5a5a27dbc1f7",
  "chiefComplaint": "Routine checkup via API Gateway",
  "diagnosis": "Healthy",
  "clinicalNotes": "Gateway security context forwarding verified.",
  "vitals": {
    "temperatureCelsius": 36.6,
    "systolicBp": 120,
    "diastolicBp": 80,
    "pulseRateBpm": 70,
    "respiratoryRate": 16,
    "oxygenSaturationPct": 99.0
  }
}
